
Da Theory ov Evereeding 
by Lisa Grunwald 

I've read dais book twice. Vewy indereztin.

Ize kno a bit aboot da goal ov Einstein and uddars tah find a theory dat 
explains "evereeding." By dais wee useyulely meanz wat is/are da 
"fundumentul" "force(s)" dat lie "at da hart" ov da youneeverze.

Mye excessive yews ov double quotes abuv iz driven by da nature ov wurds 
demselvez. Wat r da definitions ov da wurds I've quoted? Theah iz 
mystery in awl ov dem.

Da main kareactor in dais 1991 book iz Alexander Simon. He iz a 
physicist and haz spent hiz lyfe triing tah comed upe wid suech a theory.
He lives wid hiz girlfriend Leenda and their relayshunzhip iz strained.

Da book starts wid da story ov Alexander and hiz muddah Alice. He iz 
eight years owld. Dey r whatchin a stationmaster hoo iz waving a 
lantern tah warn an oncoming trayn ov a washed owd brige. Da 
stationmaster iz run ova and killed and da trayn falls into da rivah 
below. Dais expeerienz haunts him in dreams throughout hiz lyfe.

Alice leefs Alexander early awn. Zhe iz off tah plazes unknown and iz a 
student ov astrology. He hides behind hiz equations and fynlee comez upe 
wid a theory dat wiyill rock da world. Awl dings "liv" in juz two 
dimensions (nutt three, nutt faw, nutt ten) and r "strings." Dey 
mezhure 10^-23 mm across. He iz wuking foah a guy named Biner hoo iz 
constantly pushing him tah publish.

Wee learn aboot several early scientists whose breakthroughs occurred 
early in their lives, lyke hiz. Wee alzo learn wat happened aftah their 
diskuverees wur revealed. Newton went awn tah study alchemy and da 
pyramids. Boltzmann blew hiz brains owd. (Ize did nutt kno eder ov deez 
facts.)

Alexander iz close tah hiz dad, Sam. Dey plahay chess. Drink Scotch. Tawk 
aboot Alice. Dey correspond freequintlee.

Alexander befriends a wumin named Cleo. Zhe iz a palm reader. He endz upe 
moovin owd ov hiz playz and lives wid er. Leenda and he becomb 
estranged. Cleo tells him dat zhe and hiz muddah r in constant 
contact wid each udda. He misses hiz muddah terribly and tinkz Cleo 
wiyill eventually bring Alice back tah him. Dey hav sex. Zhe iz vewy 
seductive. She's a 22 and zo iz he. Luk id upe. Numerology. (I've 
axshully met a guy years ago hoo truelee believed dais stufe.)

Cleo sends him off tah liv wid a guy named Harold in Nu Jersey. He's 
into creating hiz "Pryme Mattah" and wiyill teach Alexander ow tah create 
hiz. Dais involves digging upe dirt, plantz, flowahs, collecting dew etc.
etc. Mixing da ingredients.

Creating "charts" (based awn yur tyme and playz ov birth and wheah da 
planitz wur denn) iz sumding dat Harold and he dew.

In udda wurds, Alex iz transported into a world combleetly foreign tah 
wat he iz uzed tah, considered bunk by mohst peeple. Howevah, mach ov da 
literature he iz toled tah read and da quotes wee r shown frum id (theah 
iz a sizable bibliography at da back ov da book) iz thought-provoking.
Wat iz "reyal" science and wat iz "junk" science becomes lezz clear.

Spoiler: Id takes a long tyme butz fynlee Alexander leefs Harold (whom 
wee learn iz needy himself) and finds himself being tuhched by Leenda.

Translation by Toby Speak Version 2.2o
The dishunary contains 1545 wurds.

